@page "/resources"
@using SeahawkSaverFrontend.UI.Components.Utilities

<PageTitle>Seahawk Saver | Resources</PageTitle>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.Large">
    <MudPaper Class="pa-10"
              Elevation="4">
        <SectionHeaderComponent Typo="Typo.h3">
            Resources
        </SectionHeaderComponent>
        <MudText Class="my-8"
                 Style="margin: auto;"
                 Typo="Typo.body1">
            Funding your education can be challenging, but there are numerous scholarships available to help reduce costs
            and minimize debt. From general academic scholarships to those based on specific interests, there’s likely a
            scholarship that aligns with your unique background and goals!
        </MudText>
        <SectionHeaderComponent Typo="Typo.h4">
            Types of Scholarships
        </SectionHeaderComponent>
        <ul Class="my-8"
            Style="list-style-type: disc">
            <li>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
                    <b>Merit-Based Scholarships</b>: Awarded based on academic, athletic, or artistic achievements.
                </MudText>
            </li>
            <li>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
                    <b>Need-Based Scholarships</b>: Available for students with financial need, often determined by FAFSA.
                </MudText>
            </li>
            <li>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
                    <b>Community & Service Scholarships</b>: For students actively involved in community service or leadership.
                </MudText>
            </li>
            <li>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
                    <b>Field-Specific Scholarships</b>: Designed for students pursuing particular majors or careers, like STEM or
                    the arts.
                </MudText>
            </li>
            <li>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
                    <b>Diversity & Inclusion Scholarships</b>: Targeted at underrepresented groups, promoting access and equity in
                    higher education.
                </MudText>
            </li>
        </ul>
        <SectionHeaderComponent Typo="Typo.h4">
            Where to Find Scholarships?
        </SectionHeaderComponent>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1"
                 Class="mt-8">
            To help you get started, here are a few resources where you can explore scholarship options and apply:
        </MudText>
        <ul Style="list-style-type: disc;">
            <li>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
                    <b>FAFSA & Federal Aid Programs</b>: The Free Application for Federal Student Aid (FAFSA) is essential for
                    need-based scholarships and grants. Visit the
                    <MudLink Href="https://studentaid.gov/" Target="_blank">FAFSA Website</MudLink>
                    for more details.
                </MudText>
            </li>
            <li>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
                    <b>University Scholarship Offices</b>: Many schools have dedicated offices or online portals listing
                    scholarships for their students. Check out your school’s financial aid or scholarship page for
                    opportunities.
                </MudText>
            </li>
            <MudText Class="mt-4"
                     Typo="Typo.body1">
                Here are a few websites you can use to search for scholarships:
            </MudText>
            <ul Class="mb-8"
                Style="list-style-type: disc;">
                <li>
                    <MudLink Href="https://fastweb.com" Target="_blank">
                        Fastweb
                    </MudLink>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <MudLink Href="https://scholarships.com" Target="_blank">
                        Scholarships.com
                    </MudLink>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <MudLink Href="https://collegeboard.org" Target="_blank">
                        College Board's Scholarship Search
                    </MudLink>
                </li>
            </ul>

        </ul>
        <SectionHeaderComponent Typo="Typo.h4">
            Local Scholarships
        </SectionHeaderComponent>
        <MudText Class="mt-8"
                 Typo="Typo.body1">
            Local organizations, like community foundations, clubs, and businesses, often offer scholarships for residents.
        </MudText>
        <MudText Class="mt-4"
                 Typo="Typo.body1">
            Examples include:
        </MudText>
        <ul Class="mb-8" Style="list-style-type: disc">
            <li>
                <MudLink Href="https://k00214.site.kiwanis.org/what-we-do/" Target="_blank">
                    Kiwanis
                </MudLink>
            </li>
            <li>
                <MudLink Href="https://www.wilmingtoncitycouncil.com/city-council/services/" Target="_blank">
                    City of Wilmington
                </MudLink>
            </li>
            <li>
                <MudLink Href="https://www.nhcs.net/parents/scholarship-opportunities" Target="_blank">
                    New Hanover County
                </MudLink>
            </li>
            <li>
                <MudLink Href="https://www.nccommunityfoundation.org/scholarships" Target="_blank">
                    North Carolina Community Foundation
                </MudLink>
            </li>
        </ul>
        <SectionHeaderComponent Typo="Typo.h4">
            Scholarships for North Carolina Residents
        </SectionHeaderComponent>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1"
                 Class="mt-8">
            As a Seahawk, you may be eligible for scholarships specific to North Carolina students:
        </MudText>
        <ul Style="list-style-type: disc">
            <li>
                <MudLink Href="https://www.nc.gov/learning/higher-education" Target="_blank">
                    North Carolina Department of Higher Education
                </MudLink>
            </li>
            <li>
                <MudLink Href="https://www.ncseaa.edu/" Target="_blank">
                    North Carolina State Education Assistance Authority
                </MudLink>
            </li>
            <li>
                <MudLink
                    Href="https://scholars.goldenleaf.org/#:~:text=The%20Golden%20LEAF%20Scholarship%20strives,rural%20community%20in%20the%20state."
                    Target="_blank">
                    Golden LEAF
                </MudLink>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </MudPaper>
</MudContainer>